<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Barrows and gilts sold fully $0.50, instances $1.00 higher. Demand was moderate to good on light offerings. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 52.50-54.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 40.00-43.00, few 39.00</p>
<p>		400-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00, few 46.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 45.00-47.50, few 48.00</p>
<p>		few over 600 lbs. 47.50-49.00, few 50.00</p>
</text>
